OL,3,APistol in a lake gives hope for French
OL,4,Acold case
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the unsolved
OL,7,Fmurder of a British family in France 14
OL,8,Fyears ago have an unexpected new clue
OL,9,Fwith the discovery of a Luger pistol in
OL,10,Fthe waters of a nearby lake.
OL,12,FOne of the few certainties in the
OL,13,Fkillings of Saad al-Hilli with his wife
OL,14,Fand mother-in-law ` as well as a
OL,15,Fpassing cyclist ` is that they were
OL,16,Fshot through the head with a Luger
OL,17,Fmodel P06, a type used by the Swiss
OL,18,Farmy until around 1960.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
