OL,3,APistol in a lake gives hope for French
OL,4,Acold case
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow France's cold case unit has
OL,7,Fconfirmed the discovery of a Luger in
OL,8,FLake Annecy, not far from the scene of
OL,9,Fthe murders in September 2012.
OL,11,FAccording to Marianne magazine, which
OL,12,Fbroke the story, it was British
OL,13,Ftourists on 20 August who found the
OL,14,Fweapon lying in two metres of water.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
